    *   (P[1][5] {NT19}) + (P[1][6] {NT32}) -> (NT19 NT32). Rule: NT51 -> NT19 NT32.
    *   Result: {NT51}
*   P[2][6] (`t19 t54`):
    *   (P[1][6] {NT32}) + (P[1][7] {NT41}) -> (NT32 NT41). No rule.
